{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_2efa7672308c45b8b28a7c3a","type":"tool_result","content":"3080\t<dc:date>2014</dc:date>\n3081\t<dc:type>article</dc:type>\n3082\t<dc:type>publishedVersion</dc:type>\n3083\t<dc:identifier>1310-9537</dc:identifier>\n3084\t<dc:identifier>https://rai.ai.ac.rs/handle/123456789/209</dc:identifier>\n3085\t<dc:identifier>https://hdl.handle.net/21.15107/rcub_rai_209</dc:identifier>\n3086\t<dc:identifier>2-s2.0-84903220995</dc:identifier>\n3087\t<dc:rights>restrictedAccess</dc:rights>\n3088\t<dc:rights>ARR</dc:rights>\n3089\t<dc:publisher>Nous Publishers Ltd.</dc:publisher>\n3090\t<dc:source>Archaeologia Bulgarica</dc:source>\n3091\t</oai_dc:dc></metadata></record><record><header><identifier>oai:rai.ai.ac.rs:123456789/210</identifier><datestamp>2026-07-24T08:24:30Z</datestamp><setSpec>com_123456789_1</setSpec><setSpec>col_123456789_3</setSpec><setSpec>col_123456789_413</setSpec></header><metadata><oai_dc:dc xmlns:oai_dc=\"http://www.openarchives.org/OAI/2.0/oai_dc/\" xmlns:doc=\"http://www.lyncode.com/xoai\" xmlns:xsi=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\" xmlns:dc=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\" xsi:schemaLocation=\"http://www.openarchives.org/OAI/2.0/oai_dc/ http://www.openarchives.org/OAI/2.0/oai_dc.xsd\">\n3092\t<dc:title>Excavations of Mediana in 2010 and 2011</dc:title>\n3093\t<dc:creator>Vasić, Miloje</dc:creator>\n3094\t<dc:creator>Milošević, Gordana</dc:creator>\n3095\t<dc:creator>Gavrilović, Nadežda</dc:creator>\n3096\t<dc:subject>Medijana</dc:subject>\n3097\t<dc:subject>vila s peristilom</dc:subject>\n3098\t<dc:subject>stratigrafija</dc:subject>\n3099\t<dc:subject>arhitektura</dc:subject>\n3100\t<dc:subject>pokretni nalazi</dc:subject>\n3101\t<dc:subject>kasna antika</dc:subject>\n3102\t<dc:description>Throughout 2010 and 2011, a systematic nine month archaeological exploration\n3103\t   was conducted on the north-eastern, northwestern and south-eastern parts of\n3104\t   the villa with peristyle, as well as the area in front of the museum building\n3105\t   (see note 8). The envisaged area of exploration was around 1,400 m². In\n3106\t   total, 1,230 m² of this area was thoroughly examined (Fig. 1). The\n3107\t   excavations were performed with the aim of defining the dimensions of the\n3108\t   north-western and south-western parts of the villa, the appearance of the\n3109\t   villa’s entrance, as well as to explore the foundations of the museum\n3110\t   building. In the course of the excavations, certain differences were\n3111\t   perceived in the stratigraphy of the villa with peristyle and the part\n3112\t   excavated outside the villa.</dc:description>\n3113\t<dc:date>2022-05-10T11:23:58Z</dc:date>\n3114\t<dc:date>2022-05-10T11:23:58Z</dc:date>\n3115\t<dc:date>2014</dc:date>\n3116\t<dc:type>article</dc:type>\n3117\t<dc:type>publishedVersion</dc:type>\n3118\t<dc:identifier>0350-0241</dc:identifier>\n3119\t<dc:identifier>https://rai.ai.ac.rs/handle/123456789/210</dc:identifier>\n3120\t<dc:identifier>10.2298/STA1464231V</dc:identifier>\n3121\t<dc:identifier>http://rai.ai.ac.rs/bitstream/id/92/207.pdf</dc:identifier>\n3122\t<dc:rights>openAccess</dc:rights>\n3123\t<dc:rights>https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/</dc:rights>\n3124\t<dc:rights>BY-NC-ND</dc:rights>"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"715a8e85-940b-40be-aca9-e0e9c9f6c39d","uuid":"327a0605-249c-4508-ac8c-21bf868e7fb5","timestamp":"2026-10-25T22:06:57.887Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Svemir\\data\\sessions\\c1792946760393lb6a\\medijana_baza\\roj_glm\\objekti_CD\\oai_full.xml","content":"<dc:date>2014</dc:date>\n<dc:type>article</dc:type>\n<dc:type>publishedVersion</dc:type>\n<dc:identifier>1310-9537</dc:identifier>\n<dc:identifier>https://rai.ai.ac.rs/handle/123456789/209</dc:identifier>\n<dc:identifier>https://hdl.handle.net/21.15107/rcub_rai_209</dc:identifier>\n<dc:identifier>2-s2.0-84903220995</dc:identifier>\n<dc:rights>restrictedAccess</dc:rights>\n<dc:rights>ARR</dc:rights>\n<dc:publisher>Nous Publishers Ltd.</dc:publisher>\n<dc:source>Archaeologia Bulgarica</dc:source>\n</oai_dc:dc></metadata></record><record><header><identifier>oai:rai.ai.ac.rs:123456789/210</identifier><datestamp>2026-07-24T08:24:30Z</datestamp><setSpec>com_123456789_1</setSpec><setSpec>col_123456789_3</setSpec><setSpec>col_123456789_413</setSpec></header><metadata><oai_dc:dc xmlns:oai_dc=\"http://www.openarchives.org/OAI/2.0/oai_dc/\" xmlns:doc=\"http://www.lyncode.com/xoai\" xmlns:xsi=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\" xmlns:dc=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\" xsi:schemaLocation=\"http://www.openarchives.org/OAI/2.0/oai_dc/ http://www.openarchives.org/OAI/2.0/oai_dc.xsd\">\n<dc:title>Excavations of Mediana in 2010 and 2011</dc:title>\n<dc:creator>Vasić, Miloje</dc:creator>\n<dc:creator>Milošević, Gordana</dc:creator>\n<dc:creator>Gavrilović, Nadežda</dc:creator>\n<dc:subject>Medijana</dc:subject>\n<dc:subject>vila s peristilom</dc:subject>\n<dc:subject>stratigrafija</dc:subject>\n<dc:subject>arhitektura</dc:subject>\n<dc:subject>pokretni nalazi</dc:subject>\n<dc:subject>kasna antika</dc:subject>\n<dc:description>Throughout 2010 and 2011, a systematic nine month archaeological exploration\n   was conducted on the north-eastern, northwestern and south-eastern parts of\n   the villa with peristyle, as well as the area in front of the museum building\n   (see note 8). The envisaged area of exploration was around 1,400 m². In\n   total, 1,230 m² of this area was thoroughly examined (Fig. 1). The\n   excavations were performed with the aim of defining the dimensions of the\n   north-western and south-western parts of the villa, the appearance of the\n   villa’s entrance, as well as to explore the foundations of the museum\n   building. In the course of the excavations, certain differences were\n   perceived in the stratigraphy of the villa with peristyle and the part\n   excavated outside the villa.</dc:description>\n<dc:date>2022-05-10T11:23:58Z</dc:date>\n<dc:date>2022-05-10T11:23:58Z</dc:date>\n<dc:date>2014</dc:date>\n<dc:type>article</dc:type>\n<dc:type>publishedVersion</dc:type>\n<dc:identifier>0350-0241</dc:identifier>\n<dc:identifier>https://rai.ai.ac.rs/handle/123456789/210</dc:identifier>\n<dc:identifier>10.2298/STA1464231V</dc:identifier>\n<dc:identifier>http://rai.ai.ac.rs/bitstream/id/92/207.pdf</dc:identifier>\n<dc:rights>openAccess</dc:rights>\n<dc:rights>https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/</dc:rights>\n<dc:rights>BY-NC-ND</dc:rights>","numLines":45,"startLine":3080,"totalLines":71039}}}
