-25T22:06:20.190Z\",\"subagent_type\":\"general-purpose\",\"task_description\":\"Lov na Milošević Urbanism Mediana\"}\n16310\t{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"id\":\"msg_20261026060620aeb6c13b76024778\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"model\":\"glm-5.3\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"JACKPOT! Line 198 of the Serbian Wikipedia wikitext:\\n\\n\\\"Гордана Јеремић. ''Мозаици Медијане-Нека разматрања'', {{cite web|url=http://www.ubnt.ni.ac.rs/images/pdf/nisivizantija/Nis%20i%20Vizantija%20-%2004_2005/10_Jeremic_Gordana.pdf |title=Ниш и Византија, Симпозијум |date=2005|...}}\\\"\\n\\nSo the full text PDF of Jeremić 2006 \\\"Mozaici Medijane – neka razmatranja\\\" was hosted at:\\nhttp://www.ubnt.ni.ac.rs/images/pdf/nisivizantija/Nis%20i%20Vizantija%20-%2004_2005/10_Jeremic_Gordana.pdf\\n\\nThat's the University of Niš site (ubnt.ni.ac.rs). \\\"Nis i Vizantija - 04_2005\\\" folder. The PDF may still be there or may be dead. Note the access-date was 12. 4. 2013, so the link may be old/dead. Let me try to fetch it with webReader (but webReader returns markdown, not PDF download — it might still extract text from PDF? Unsure). Since Bash is denied, I can't curl it. webReader with a PDF URL may fail or return text.\\n\\nAlso line 208 reveals ANOTHER Jeremić work: \\\"Јеремић Г, ''Мозаици грађевине са октогоном из Античког Наиса'', Ниш и Византіја 5, Ниш, 2007.\\\" — Jeremić G., \\\"Mozaici građevine sa oktogonom iz Antičkog Naisa\\\" (Mosaics of the building with the octagon from ancient Naissus), Niš i Vizantija 5, Niš 2007. That's another Jeremić work on mosaics (building with octagon — that's the \\\"villa with octagon\\\" at Mediana? Actually \\\"građevina sa oktogonom\\\" is at Mediana/Brzi Brod — the second most important building). Great.\\n\\nLet me continue reading the wikitext to find more Jeremić references and objects A-D. Let me grep for \\\"Јеремић\\\" in the wikitext (Cyrillic).\",\"signature\":\"c257c777a76c4cc69f15bdb0\"}],\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":0},\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":\"call_228a9101adba430ca741f6e2\",\"session_id\":\"715a8e85-940b-40be-aca9-e0e9c9f6c39d\",\"uuid\":\"cadf5108-2e76-43f9-a5db-82859afe7d80\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-25T22:06:27.153Z\",\"subagent_type\":\"general-purpose\",\"task_description\":\"Lov na Jeremić 2006 mozaici\"}\n16311\t{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"id\":\"msg_20261026060620aeb6c13b76024778\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"model\":\"glm-5.3\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"PREKOKLOP! Našao sam direktan URL do PDF-a rada Jeremić 2006 na sajtu Univerziteta u Nišu, plus još jedan rad (Niš i Vizantija 5, 2007). Nastaviću čitanje wikitexta.\"}],\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":0},\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":\"call_228a9101adba430ca741f6e2\",\"session_id\":\"715a8e85-940b-40be-aca9-e0e9c9f6c39d\",\"uuid\":\"a74f1375-f2f8-4864-816d-649959649f66\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-25T22:06:28.085Z\",\"subagent_type\":\"general-purpose\",\"task_description\":\"Lov na Jeremić 2006 mozaici\"}\n16312\t{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"id\":\"msg_20261026060620aeb6c13b76024778\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"model\":\"glm-5.3\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"call_e66c1b02354643fab2825e60\",\"name\":\"Grep\",\"input\":{\"-n\":true,\"head_limit\":40,\"output_mode\":\"content\",\"path\":\"C:/Svemir/data/sessions/c1792946760393lb6a/medijana_baza/roj_glm/objekti_CD/srwiki_medijana.wikitext\",\"pattern\":\"Јеремић\"}}],\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":0},\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":\"call_228a9101adba430ca741f6e2\",\"session_id\":\"715a8e85-940b-40be-aca9-e0e9c9f6c39d\",\"uuid\":\"6da704a7-f5f1-4485-ab73-04c626e01ebc\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-25T22:06: