 и Византија 5, Ниш, 2007 — \\\"Mosaics of the building with the octagon from ancient Naissus\\\" — Niš i Vizantija 5. So there is a Jeremić 2007 paper too, in Niš i Vizantija V. Probably also on ubnt.ni.ac.rs: http://www.ubnt.ni.ac.rs/images/pdf/nisivizantija/Nis%20i%20Vizantija%20-%2005.../...Jeremic...\\n\\nWait, actually — is the \\\"građevina sa oktogonom iz Antičkog Naisa\\\" the Mediana octagon? The villa with octagon at Mediana (\\\"Amadžijska njiva\\\") — yes, \\\"građevina sa oktogonom\\\" is part of the Mediana complex (building with octagonal and circular room, north of the horreum, per line 190: \\\"северно грађевина са кружном и октогоналном просторијом\\\"). So Jeremić 2007 in Niš i Vizantija 5 is about mosaics of that building. \\n\\nNow — the site nisandbyzantium.org.rs is mentioned (line 284): http://www.nisandbyzantium.org.rs/ — the \\\"Niš i Vizantija\\\" symposium website. The zbornici PDFs are hosted there. Also the old ubnt.ni.ac.rs URL.\\n\\nNow let me try the webReader again (rate limit may have reset) for:\\n1. http://www.ubnt.ni.ac.rs/images/pdf/nisivizantija/Nis%20i%20Vizantija%20-%2004_2005/10_Jeremic_Gordana.pdf — direct PDF of Jeremić 2006.\\n2. http://www.nisandbyzantium.org.rs/ — main site, look for zbornik IV and V.\\n\\nNote: the webReader error \\\"-400: Please Enter the Correct URL Format!\\\" for the Bing URL with quotes/encoded chars. For the PDF URL with %20 encodings it might also fail... Let me try. Actually the first call failed with -400 because of the encoded quotes maybe. The second (unencoded with spaces? no — \\\"https://www.bing.com/search?q=Mozaici+Medijane+Jeremic\\\" — valid) failed with -429 rate limit. So the format rule may reject some URLs. Let me try the direct PDF URL (encoded) and if -400, try alternate.\\n\\nActually, maybe try the nisandbyzantium.org.rs site first since it's the official host. The old URL path on ubnt.ni.ac.rs is likely dead (the site moved). The nisandbyzantium.org.rs site has \\\"Zbornik