{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20261026060659d13e84d34b8e434a","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.3","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent findings from the OAI harvest (RAI repo):\n\n1. **Vasić, Milošević, Gavrilović 2014 — \"Excavations of Mediana in 2010 and 2011\"** — Starinar 64 (0350-0241), DOI 10.2298/STA1464231V, openAccess CC BY-NC-ND, PDF at http://rai.ai.ac.rs/bitstream/id/92/207.pdf. This IS the Starinar 64/2014 article — wait, the base already has \"crtezi Starinara 64/2014\" (Sl. 1 situational plan W/E numbering). So this is already in the base. But the full text may contain data on objects C/D? Actually the base's crtezi_sloj came from Starinar 64/2014 — same article. OK, known.\n\n2. **Jeremić 2017 Meduza** — already on disk (jeremic_meduza_2017.pdf/txt).\n\n3. Jeremić glass 2018, Jagodin Mala — not directly C/D.\n\nBut the OAI harvest is the RAI repo catalog! The key: the pale session downloaded OAI full records — 7.8 MB. This is essentially the RAI repository catalog in DC format. I can now LIST ALL Mediana-related records and check for: Milošević \"Urbanism and Architecture\", Drča 2000, Petrović 1994, objects A-D reports.\n\nNote: the harvest has resumptionToken \"oai_dc////100\" — meaning it's only the FIRST 100 records?! Line 1: resumptionToken=\"oai_dc////100\". Hmm — that means oai_full.xml contains only records 1-100 (of the RAI repo)... But wait, identifiers go up to 123456789/979 at line 29400+. So maybe multiple harvests concatenated: oai_all.xml, oai_2020.xml too. The resumptionToken at line 1 suggests the file starts with a ListRecords response for first 100 records, but then... Actually if identifiers up to /979 appear, the harvest covered many. But resumptionToken \"oai_dc////100\" at line 1 with identifiers oai:rai.ai.ac.rs:123456789/104, /105, /106... at lines 1-85 — those are the first 100 records. Then the file continues with more records? Maybe oai_full.xml = concatenation of several pages. Let me check total line count and whether there are more resumptionTokens.\n\nMore importantly: grep for Milošević, Gordana as creator + titles in the OAI files; grep for Drča; grep for \"Urbanism\". The Milošević \"Urbanism and Architecture of the Imperial Domain at Mediana\" — if it's in RAI, it's in the OAI catalog. Earlier finding was \"RAI ga nema\" (via old search API 404). But OAI harvest may reveal it!\n\nAlso grep for \"Petrović\" + \"Mediana\" titles, and Cyrillic \"Медијана\".\n\nLet me do these greps now on all three OAI files. Also check remaining Mediana hits in oai_full.xml (lines 241, 1756-1766, 4820, 20588, 28263, 29631).\n\nAnd check the file end/size — how many records total. Grep count of \"<record>\" in each file.","signature":"b8058c7e94574d50abd54a98"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"715a8e85-940b-40be-aca9-e0e9c9f6c39d","uuid":"eb7e65ef-2101-4792-99ec-c0e2dab02226","timestamp":"2026-10-25T22:07:11.262Z"}
