{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202610260607352196f1cad9674454","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.3","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have three open-access works by Gordana Milošević relevant to Medijana, all with full-text PDFs in RAI:\n\n1. **\"Excavations of Mediana in 2010 and 2011\"** — Vasić, Miloje; Milošević, Gordana; Gavrilović, Nadežda. Starinar 64 (2014), DOI 10.2298/STA1464231V, handle https://rai.ai.ac.rs/handle/123456789/210, PDF http://rai.ai.ac.rs/bitstream/id/92/207.pdf, openAccess, CC BY-NC-ND. Abstract: 9-month excavations, NE/NW/SE parts of villa with peristyle + area in front of museum, ~1400 m² planned, 1230 m² examined, goal to define dimensions of NW and SW parts, villa entrance, museum foundations. NOTE: this is Starinar 64/2014 — the base already has \"crtezi Starinara 64/2014\" — so this is likely already known to the database (commit 68a0dda mentions Starinar 64/2014). But the DOI 10.2298/STA1464231V suggests pages 423–431? Actually STA1464231V = Starinar 64, page 423, V (Vasić). Pages 423-?\n\n2. **\"Carska ideologija u arhitekturi, umetnosti i skulpturi rimske vile na Medijani\"** — Milošević, Gordana; Gavrilović, Nadežda. In: Zbornik radova 1700 godina Milanskog edikta (Niš: Pravni fakultet Univerziteta u Nišu, 2013), ISBN 978-86-7148-176-2, bookPart, openAccess, PDF http://rai.ai.ac.rs/bitstream/id/4442/bitstream_4442.pdf, handle https://rai.ai.ac.rs/handle/123456789/1555. Abstract: villa with peristyle and thermae, villa with octagon, warehouses with workshops and military barracks, two early Christian basilicas, necropoles, several smaller village villas; new research 2010-2012; building phases; Constantine.\n\n3. **\"Constantine's Villa at Mediana\"** — monograph, Vasić, Miloje; Milošević, Gordana; Gavrilović Vitas, Nadežda; Crnoglavac, Vesna. Niš: National Museum Niš, 2016, ISBN 978-86-83019-46-5, openAccess, PDF http://rai.ai.ac.rs/bitstream/id/4423/bitstream_4423.pdf, handle https://rai.ai.ac.rs/handle/123456789/1539.\n\nNow — the target paper \"Urbanism and Architecture of the Imperial Domain at Mediana\". Could it be a chapter in the 2016 monograph \"Constantine's Villa at Mediana\"? The monograph is in English (\"Constantine's Villa at Mediana\", dc:language en). A monograph about the administrative-residential complex — could contain a chapter by Milošević titled \"Urbanism and Architecture of the Imperial Domain at Mediana\". That would explain the Academia.edu upload (Milošević uploading her own chapter). The Academia URL ID 44911502 dates from ~Dec 2020-Jan 2021. Upload date doesn't preclude 2016 chapter.\n\nAlternatively it could be in \"The Age of Tetrarchs\" or some Limes volume. But the most probable home: the 2016 monograph. I should try to fetch the monograph PDF or its handle page to check the table of contents.\n\nwebReader has been 429 for many calls. Let me try again now — time has passed (several minutes of tool calls). If webReader works, fetch:\n1. https://rai.ai.ac.rs/handle/123456789/1539 (monograph record — may show TOC/abstract)\n2. http://rai.ai.ac.rs/bitstream/id/4423/bitstream_4423.pdf (PDF — webReader might extract text? Maybe not)\n\nLet me try the handle page first.","signature":"f3566604d6da45edb9c00a27"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"call_58909c1e0d5f4aed9a483050","session_id":"715a8e85-940b-40be-aca9-e0e9c9f6c39d","uuid":"d9e0fbbb-f3c8-4139-85b8-6ae907c83ea4","timestamp":"2026-10-25T22:07:49.515Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Lov na Milošević Urbanism Mediana"}
