t may have cleared) on: (a) RAI DSpace7 search for \"Mediana\" — NO wait, I already have the full OAI catalog locally! 2338 records. The RAI search adds nothing. Instead use web_reader on the two PDF bitstream URLs — web_reader might extract PDF text! Try on bitstream_4442.pdf (2013) and bitstream_4423.pdf (monograph 2016). Those are THE top targets now for objects C/D (monograph covers villa+thermae+gate = likely the C/D objects).\n4. Also from OAI catalog: search for more handles with \"Mediana\" in title that I haven't seen — I saw lines 241 (Kržince migration — irrelevant), 1756 (Venus/Diana), 3092 (Starinar 64), 28263 (frescoes), 29426 (Medusa), 29631 (glass bead), 27931 (glass), 4820 (unread), 20588 (tourism), 5881/14161 (Bronze Age — irrelevant), 18749 (Niš fortress projects list). Let me check 4820 quickly.\n\nAlso grep catalog for \"term\" (terme) in titles — the thermae report!","signature":"dd1556ed19634887a9ddb85a"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"715a8e85-940b-40be-aca9-e0e9c9f6c39d","uuid":"49b4c31c-3aa4-4375-ba8c-3fee852cee64","timestamp":"2026-10-25T22:08:42.564Z"}
