{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_2026102606095002c66c4f5aa64e02","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.3","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The aus2011.txt is incomplete — it only extracted the front matter (pages up to ~13 + CIP), not the article on p. 78. The PDF is only 205KB — likely also incomplete or the text extraction failed for the rest. Hmm, actually 112 pages in 205KB PDF is unlikely — it's probably a partial download.\n\nThe bigger aus files (aus2017.txt 450KB, aus2018 605KB, aus2019 596KB, aus2020 391KB, aus2021 460KB, aus2016 302KB) probably contain full reports. The Medijana report in aus2019 (thermae 2019, N. Gavrilović-Vitas) was found around line 7200 — that's the project report section. Let me read the aus2019 Mediana report fully — lines ~7150-7240. It also has a bibliography entry (line 7234-7235: a 2019 article vol 35, 65-83 — probably Gavrilović-Vitas in Zbornik Narodnog muzeja Niš? Let me look).\n\nAlso check aus2015 (only 19KB — partial too, front matter). aus2016/2017/2018/2020/2021 for Mediana reports.\n\nLet me read aus2019 lines 7140-7240.","signature":"650fbd3cd93742019f5afa2c"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"call_228a9101adba430ca741f6e2","session_id":"715a8e85-940b-40be-aca9-e0e9c9f6c39d","uuid":"fae7b480-9754-4ace-abeb-9582cb7d91ab","timestamp":"2026-10-25T22:09:56.826Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Lov na Jeremić 2006 mozaici"}
