{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_d121726de7f94e44b3eee48e","type":"tool_result","content":"4829\t   stibadium B revealed that the stibadium walls were decorated with a facing of\n4830\t   marble slabs and the floor was covered with exceptionally well preserved high\n4831\t   quality mosaic. Archaeological excavations in 2015 defined completely the\n4832\t   system of floor and wall heating. The mosaic floors in stibadium B are\n4833\t   conserved. The area to the west of the stibadium has also been explored and a\n4834\t   channel with the remains of a lead water pipe was discovered there. The\n4835\t   terrain to the north of the northern wall of the villa with peristyle was\n4836\t   also levelled.</dc:description>\n4837\t<dc:date>2022-05-10T11:26:55Z</dc:date>\n4838\t<dc:date>2022-05-10T11:26:55Z</dc:date>\n4839\t<dc:date>2016</dc:date>\n4840\t<dc:type>article</dc:type>\n4841\t<dc:type>publishedVersion</dc:type>\n4842\t<dc:identifier>0350-0241</dc:identifier>\n4843\t<dc:identifier>https://rai.ai.ac.rs/handle/123456789/254</dc:identifier>\n4844\t<dc:identifier>10.2298/STA1666081G</dc:identifier>\n4845\t<dc:identifier>http://rai.ai.ac.rs/bitstream/id/123/251.pdf</dc:identifier>\n4846\t<dc:relation>info:eu-repo/grantAgreement/MESTD/Basic Research (BR or ON)/177007/RS//</dc:relation>\n4847\t<dc:rights>openAccess</dc:rights>\n4848\t<dc:rights>https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/</dc:rights>\n4849\t<dc:rights>BY-NC-ND</dc:rights>\n4850\t<dc:publisher>Arheološki institut, Beograd</dc:publisher>\n4851\t<dc:source>Starinar</dc:source>\n4852\t</oai_dc:dc></metadata></record><record><header><identifier>oai:rai.ai.ac.rs:123456789/255</identifier><datestamp>2025-12-31T09:37:06Z</datestamp><setSpec>com_123456789_1</setSpec><setSpec>col_123456789_3</setSpec></header><metadata><oai_dc:dc xmlns:oai_dc=\"http://www.openarchives.org/OAI/2.0/oai_dc/\" xmlns:doc=\"http://www.lyncode.com/xoai\" xmlns:xsi=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XML