načni objekat), **situacioni\\n28\\tplan** (ceo kompleks), **presek** — nikad „tlocrt\\\"; svaka tvrdnja sa URL izvorom i poverenjem;\\n29\\tkonflikti između izvora se upisuju, ne rešavaju na silu; bez npm instalacija; ne komituju;\\n30\\tograničenja upisati iskreno (koji izvor ne radi, šta je iza prijave).\\n31\\t\"}]},\"uuid\":\"affd5d11-2e1e-4f2b-bd73-1fcb3c486451\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-25T22:05:47.097Z\",\"sourceToolAssistantUUID\":\"e797590e-4b19-4d1b-ae3e-8fff4e10a3a9\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"sdk-cli\",\"cwd\":\"C:\\\\Svemir\\\\data\\\\sessions\\\\c1792946760393lb6a\\\\medijana_baza\\\\roj_glm\\\\objekti_CD\",\"sessionId\":\"715a8e85-940b-40be-aca9-e0e9c9f6c39d\",\"version\":\"2.1.232\",\"gitBranch\":\"master\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"affd5d11-2e1e-4f2b-bd73-1fcb3c486451\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"agentId\":\"a7308cdff85b75b5c\",\"message\":{\"id\":\"msg_2026102606054756bd21c268464f7a\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"model\":\"glm-5.3\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"The prior session's task file. Now let me look at srwiki_medijana.wikitext for references to Milošević, and check the izvrsavanje.log via Grep for key lines (it's 3.6MB). Let me grep for \\\"Urbanism\\\", \\\"Imperial Domain\\\", \\\"Illyricum\\\", \\\"Tetrarch\\\" in the log and wikitext.\",\"signature\":\"a692f3c1311b4688a8e46baa\"}],\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":0}},\"attributionAgent\":\"general-purpose\",\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"8cf2cf06-5aea-47c4-b61d-62b6c348798d\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-25T22:05:49.942Z\",\"effort\":\"high\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"sdk-cli\",\"cwd\":\"C:\\\\Svemir\\\\data\\\\sessions\\\\c1792946760393lb6a\\\\medijana_baza\\\\roj_glm\\\\objekti_CD\",\"sessionId\":\"715a8e85-940b-40be-aca9-e0e9c9f6c39d\",\"version\":\"2.1.232\",\"gitBranch\":\"master\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"8cf2cf06-5aea-47c4-b61d-62b6c348798d\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"a