  Bulletin de l'Association internationale pour l`�tude de la mosa�que antique fasc. 4, Paris 1973.\\n443\\t\\n444\\t         Trovabene 2005 - G. Trovabene, Divinit� e personificazioni fluviali nei pavimenti musivi tardo\\n445\\t              antichi: aspetti iconografici e variazioni semantiche, :    (Nis i Vizantija) III\\n446\\t              2005, 119-130.\\n447\\t\\n448\\t         Vasi 2005 - M. Vasi, Mediana - domaine imp�rial ou bien priv�?, in: R�mische St�dte und\\n449\\t              Festungen an der Donau, Akten der regionalen Konferenz, organisiert von A. von Humboldt-\\n450\\t              Stiftung, Beograd 16-19 Oktober 2003, M. Mirkovi Hrsg., Beograd 2005, 167-176.\\n451\\t\\n452\\t         Vasi 2006 - M. Vasi, Stibadium in Romuliana and Mediana, in: Felix Romvliana. 50 Years of\\n453\\t              Archaeological Excavations, Papers from the International Conference, Zajecar, 27th-29th October\\n454\\t              2003, Belgrade 2006, 69-75.\\n455\\t\\n456\\t         Vasi 2007 - M. Vasi, Mediana � eine kaiserliche Villa bei Nis, in: U. Brandl, M. Vasi, Roms\\n457\\t              Erbe auf dem Balkan. Sp�tantike Kaiservillen und Stadtanlagen in Serbien, Mainz am Rhein 2007,\\n458\\t              96-197.\\n459\\t\\n460\\t          2013 - . . ,         \\n461\\t               , :      313.   \\n462\\t                  , . , . - (.), \\n463\\t              2013, 76-101. (M. R. Vasi, Gradovi i carske vile u rimskim provincijama na teritoriji danasnje\\n464\\t              Srbije, u: Konstantin Veliki i Milanski edikt 313. Raanje hrisanstva u rimskim provincijama na\\n465\\t              tlu Srbije, I. Popovi, B. Bori-Breskovi (ed.), Beograd 2013, 76-101.)\\n466\\t\\n467\\t         Witts 2000 - P. Witts, Mosaics and room function: the evidence from some fourth-century\\n468\\t              Romano-British villas, Britannia 31 2000, 291-324.\\n469\\t\\n470\\t         Zotovi, Petrovi 1969 - Lj. Zotovi, N. Petrovi, Medijana, Brzi brod, Nis, anticka carska palata,\\n471\\t              Arheoloski pregled 11 1969, 185-186.\\n472\\t\\n473\\t262\\n474\\t\\f\"}]},\"uuid\":\"7be20fbc-b479-4c8b-b4ec-2bbee3f22ecf\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-25T22:05:02.854Z\",\"sourceToolAssistantUUID\":\"a87ea70e-430c-4f84-8a02-edc64704dc7f\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"sdk-cli\",\"cwd\":\"C:\\\\Svemir\\\\data\\\\sessions\\\\c1792946760393lb6a\\\\medijana_baza\\\\roj_glm\\\\objekti_CD\",\"sessionId\":\"715a8e85-940b-40be-aca9-e0e9c9f6c39d\",\"version\":\"2.1.232\",\"gitBranch\":\"master\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"7be20fbc-b479-4c8b-b4ec-2bbee3f22ecf\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"agentId\":\"af3648b6823f6e54f\",\"message\":{\"id\":\"msg_202610260605031e0b7a9bfc9d485c\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"model\":\"glm-5.3\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"Excellent! This is a major finding. The bibliography of Jeremić 2017 (Meduza paper) gives the exact reference for Jeremić 2006:\\n\\n**G. Jeremić, \\\"Mozaici Medijane — neka razmatranja\\\" (Mosaics of Mediana — some considerations), in: Niš i Vizantija, Zbornik radova IV (Niš and Byzantium, Proceedings IV), Četvrti naučni skup, Niš 3.–5. jun 2005, Niš 2006, 145–158.**\\n\\nSo the exact title is \\\"Mozaici Medijane – neka razmatranja\\\", pages 145-158 (note: the in-text citation says 145-157, the bibliography says 145-158), published in \\\"Niš i Vizantija IV\\\", proceedings of the 4th scholarly conference held in Niš, 3–5 June 2005, published 2006 by Centar za crkvene studije, Niš.\\n\\nAlso confirmed:\\n- Jeremić 2010: doctoral dissertation \\\"Kasnoantički mozaici iz profanih objekata na teritoriji provincija Dacia Ripensis, Dacia Mediterranea i Dardania\\\", Filozofski fakultet, Beograd, 2010. (PhD thesis — late antique mosaics from secular buildings in Dacia Ripensis, Dacia Mediterranea and Dardania.)\\n- The 2017 Meduza paper was published in \\\"Ante Portam Auream, Studia in Honorem Professoris Aleksandar Jovanović\\\" — pages 251-262.\\n\\nWait — where was the Meduza paper downloaded from? Let me check the rai files (rai_1184.html, rai_783.html, rai_3503.html, rai_api_mediana.json). RAI = Arheološki institut (rai.ai.ac.rs? or rai.ac.rs?). The PDF jeremic_meduza_2017.pdf was downloaded from somewhere. Let me look at the saved JSON/HTML files to find the URLs.\\n\\nNow the remaining tasks:\\n1. Full text of Jeremić 2006 \\\"Mozaici Medijane – neka razmatranja\\\" (Niš i Vizantija IV, 145-158). Look for PDF on sccs.rs (Centar za crkvene studije), scindeks, etc.\\n2. Full text of the 2009 \\\"New Archaeological Data on the Mosaics in Mediana near Nis\\\" — where was the abstract downloaded from? Probably from a conference abstracts site. Let me check the saved files.\\n3. Works about objects A/B/C/D of Medijana.\\n\\nTools: WebSearch denied, WebFetch denied, Bash denied. I have mcp__web_reader__webReader left — let me test if it works.\\n\\nLet me first check the saved files to reconstruct what was found and from where:\\n- rai_api_mediana.json — probably an API response from rai.ac.rs listing Mediana-related papers\\n- rai_783.html, rai_1184.html, rai_3503.html — individual pages\\n- scindeks1.html — SCIndeks search\\n- openaire1.json, gb1.json, gb2.json, ia1.json, hathi1.json, fasti_mediana.json\\n\\nLet me read these smaller JSON files first.\",\"signature\":\"7eec783b77b0475eaf1f71b2\"}],\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":0}},\"attributionAgent\":\"general-purpose\",\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"9d2fb93e-b8d3-48c1-926d-d37e64850a74\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-25T22:05:15.843Z\",\"effort\":\"high\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"sdk-cli\",\"cwd\":\"C:\\\\Svemir\\\\data\\\\sessions\\\\c1792946760393lb6a\\\\medijana_baza\\\\roj_glm\\\\objekti_CD\",\"sessionId\":\"715a8e85-940b-40be-aca9-e0e9c9f6c39d\",\"version\":\"2.1.232\",\"gitBranch\":\"master\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"9d2fb93e-b8d3-48c1-926d-d37e64850a74\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"agentId\":\"af3