з Античког Наиса'', Ниш и Византіја 5, Ниш, 2007.\\\\\\\" — Jeremić G., \\\\\\\"Mozaici građevine sa oktogonom iz Antičkog Naisa\\\\\\\" (Mosaics of the building with the octagon from ancient Naissus), Niš i Vizantija 5, Niš 2007. That's another Jeremić work on mosaics (building with octagon — that's the \\\\\\\"villa with octagon\\\\\\\" at Mediana? Actually \\\\\\\"građevina sa oktogonom\\\\\\\" is at Mediana/Brzi Brod — the second most important building). Great.\\\\n\\\\nLet me continue reading the wikitext to find more Jeremić references and objects A-D. Let me grep for \\\\\\\"Јеремић\\\\\\\" in the wikitext (Cyrillic).\\\",\\\"signature\\\":\\\"c257c777a76c4cc69f15bdb0\\\"}],\\\"stop_reason\\\":null,\\\"stop_sequence\\\":null,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"input_tokens\\\":0,\\\"output_tokens\\\":0},\\\"context_management\\\":null},\\\"parent_tool_use_id\\\":\\\"call_228a9101adba430ca741f6e2\\\",\\\"session_id\\\":\\\"715a8e85-940b-40be-aca9-e0e9c9f6c39d\\\",\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"cadf5108-2e76-43f9-a5db-82859afe7d80\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-10-25T22:06:27.153Z\\\",\\\"subagent_type\\\":\\\"general-purpose\\\",\\\"task_description\\\":\\\"Lov na Jeremić 2006 mozaici\\\"}\\n16311\\t{\\\"type\\\":\\\"assistant\\\",\\\"message\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_20261026060620aeb6c13b76024778\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"message\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"assistant\\\",\\\"model\\\":\\\"glm-5.3\\\",\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"PREKOKLOP! Našao sam direktan URL do PDF-a rada Jeremić 2006 na sajtu Univerziteta u Nišu, plus još jedan rad (Niš i Vizantija 5, 2007). Nastaviću čitanje wikitexta.\\\"}],\\\"stop_reason\\\":null,\\\"stop_sequence\\\":null,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"input_tokens\\\":0,\\\"output_tokens\\\":0},\\\"context_management\\\":null},\\\"parent_tool_use_id\\\":\\\"call_228a9101adba430ca741f6e2\\\",\\\"session_id\\\":\\\"715a8e85-940b-40be-aca9-e0e9c9f6c39d\\\",\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"a74f1375-f2f8-4864-816d-649959649f66\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-10-25T22:06:28.08