aphy item belongs to the project \\\"Carski gradovi, palate i rezidencije\\\" section (report by I. Popović). The first item (line 7234) is a 2019 publication by (probably) Gavrilović-Vitas about Mediana thermae, in a volume 35, pp. 65-83.\\n\\nWait — I recall! \\\"Зборник Народног музеја Ниш\\\" — no. Let me think about journals with volume 35 in 2019 in Serbia: \\\"Гласник Етнографског института\\\" 68? \\\"Историјски часопис\\\" 68? \\\"Зборник радова Етнографског музеја\\\" 83? \\\"Балканичка\\\"? \\\"Годишњак\\\" 48? Hmm — \\\"Добаји\\\"? Actually: \\\"Nedeljković\\\"? \\n\\nAlternative: it might be \\\"„Терме Константинове виле на Медијани“, Ниш и Византија 8\\\"? no.\\n\\nActually — could be Гавриловић-Витас Н., \\\"Терме на Медијани\\\", Гласник Друштва конзерватора Србије 43 (2019)? vol 43 no.\\n\\nOK — better to read the PDF page. But the more important thing: this level of detail (which journal) matters less for the report than the Medijana content itself. But the 2019 thermae article (65-83) IS a key source for the thermae of the villa — useful. Let me try reading the PDF around that page.\\n\\nActually — hold on. Volume 35, 2019, 65-83... \\\"Зборник радова Београдског универзитета\\\"? Hmm, could also be \\\"Arheologija u Srbiji i...\\\" Let me just read the PDF. The Read tool with pages param — aus2019.pdf. Printed page 305 = let me estimate PDF page: the PDF is the whole zbornik (312+ printed pages + covers). Front matter probably ~6 pages. So printed 305 ≈ PDF page 311. Let me read pages 308-315 to catch the bibliography section and check figure captions. Actually the bibliography is on printed page 305 which we saw at txt line 7232-7235 — Slika 3 caption is on printed 305. So PDF page ~311. Let me read aus2019.pdf pages 309-314.\\n\\nActually wait — better: grep-like precision isn't possible on PDF; Read pages 1-5 to see front matter offset? That's extra calls. Let me just try pages 310-313.\\n\\nHmm, but actually there's a subtlety: I recall that Gavrilović-Vitas published \\\"Терме Константинове виле на Медијани\\\" in Ниш и Византија? Or maybe in \\\"Гласник Друштва конзерватора\\\"? Let me just read the PDF.\\n\\nAlso for objects A-D: FASTI files! Let me check fasti_n.html (3.7KB) and tapavicki_2011.txt (FASTI record of Tapavički-Ilić Medijana 2011 excavation — actually tapavicki_medijana_2011_fasti.pdf 446KB). Let me read tapavicki_2011.txt now (4.8KB) — a FASTI record about Medijana 2011 excavations.\",\"signature\":\"5fac3cd269564ba2be798bc9\"}],\"stop_reason\":\"tool_use\",\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":3123,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":0,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":114496,\"output_tokens\":1522,\"output_tokens_details\":{\"thinking_tokens\":0},\"server_tool_use\":{\"web_search_requests\":0,\"web_fetch_requests\":0},\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0},\"inference_geo\":\"\",\"iterations\":[],\"speed\":\"standard\"},\"stop_details\":null},\"attributionAgent\":\"general-purpose\",\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"04672d4e-af03-462f-b61c-a1ec598f9886\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-25T22:10:22.144Z\",\"effort\":\"high\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"sdk-cli\",\"cwd\":\"C:\\\\Svemir\\\\data\\\\sessions\\\\c1792946760393lb6a\\\\medijana_baza\\\\roj_glm\\\\objekti_CD\",\"sessionId\":\"715a8e85-940b-40be-aca9-e0e9c9f6c39d\",\"version\":\"2.1.232\",\"gitBranch\":\"master\",\"slug\":\"cached-soaring-sedgewick\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"04672d4e-af03-462f-b61c-a1ec598f9886\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"agentId\":\"af3648b6823f6e54f\",\"message\":{\"id\":\"msg_20261026060957d4ef7351efc64d51\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"model\":\"glm-5.3\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Pročitajću Tapavički FASTI izveštaj i pokušati PDF stranu sa bibliografijom u aus2019.\"}],\"stop_reason\":\"tool_use\",\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":3123,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":0,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":114496,\"output_tokens\":1522,\"output_tokens_details\":{\"thinking_tokens\":0},\"server_tool_use\":{\"web_search_requests\":0,\"web_fetch_requests\":0},\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0},\"inference_geo\":\"\",\"iterations\":[],\"speed\":\"standard\"},\"stop_details\":null},\"attributionAgent\":\"general-purpose\",\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"d63fd0e4-0a43-4659-9d5c-66e93de2ff9d\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-25T22:10:22.147Z\",\"effort\":\"high\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"sdk-cli\",\"cwd\":\"C:\\\\Svemir\\\\data\\\\sessions\\\\c1792946760393lb6a\\\\medijana_baza\\\\roj_glm\\\\objekti_CD\",\"sessionId\":\"715a8e85-940b-40be-aca9-e0e9c9f6c39d\",\"version\":\"2.1.232\",\"gitBranch\":\"master\",\"slug\":\"cached-soaring-sedgewick\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"d63fd0e4-0a43-4659-9d5c-66e93de2ff9d\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"agentId\":\"af3648b6823f6e54f\",\"message\":{\"id\":\"msg_20261026060957d4ef7351efc64d51\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"model\":\"glm-5.3\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"call_e72b5790d1d746dcb1407f60\",\"name\":\"Read\",\"input\":{\"file_path\":\"C:/Svemir/data/sessions/c1792946760393lb6a/medijana_baza/roj_glm/objekti_CD/skinuto/tapavicki_2011.txt\"}}],\"stop_reason\":\"tool_use\",\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":3123,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":0,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":114496,\"output_tokens\":1522,\"output_tokens_details\":{\"thinking_tokens\":0},\"server_tool_use\":{\"web_search_requests\":0,\"web_fetch_requests\":0},\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0},\"inference_geo\":\"\",\"iterations\":[],\"speed\":\"standard\"},\"stop_details\":null},\"attributionAgent\":\"general-purpose\",\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"a63c663c-f441-45df-b33d-ba2ce005f4d9\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-25T22:10:22.222Z\",\"effort\":\"high\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"sdk-cli\",\"cwd\":\"C:\\\\Svemir\\\\data\\\\sessions\\\\c1792946760393lb6a\\\\medijana_baza\\\\roj_glm\\\\objekti_CD\",\"sessionId\":\"715a8e85-940b-40be-aca9-e0e9c9f6c39d\",\"version\":\"2.1.232\",\"gitBranch\":\"master\",\"slug\":\"cached-soaring-sedgewick\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"a63c663c-f441-45df-b33d-ba2ce005f4d9\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"promptId\":\"8f7a7d2d-dfff-49d8-9afd-b83bde684221\",\"agentId\":\"af3648b6823f6e54f\",\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"call_e72b5790d1d746dcb1407f60\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"1\\t                                                  MEDIANA 2011\\n2\\t\\n3\\t         The archaeological site Mediana covers the area of 80 ha and it is situated in the non-urban\\n4\\tNis zone. The excavation in 2011 brought research of the villa with peristyle to an end. It is a\\n5\\tlongitudinal structure that runs NE � SW and covers the area of about 6500 m2. It possesses a\\n6\\tcentral part in the shape of a peristyle and a monumental audience hall in the north, but also a large\\n7\\tnumber of rooms of administrative and residential character on both sides of the peristyle.\\n8\\t\\n9\\t         The 2011 excavation was aimed at the northern, residential villa part, rooms around the\\n10\\ttriclinium and the rooms in the south, i.e., at the villa entrance. Two trenches were opened in the\\n11\\tNE villa corner marked as 95 (7.30  2 m) and 96 (3.80  2 m). Two control trenches in the room\\n12\\tmarked -22 contained layers of ancient rubble, lying of an older mortar floor. Beneath it there was\\n13\\ta hypocaust.\\n14\\t\\n15\\t         In this area, running north, trench 97 was opened and to the north from it trenches 98, 103\\n16\\tand 104. In trench 97 (6.70  4 m), a rectangular structure made of boulders in a dry wall was\\n17\\tunearthed, leaning on the northern villa facade.\\n18\\t\\n19\\t         In the control profile between the trenches 46 and 47 a marble head of a goddess was\\n20\\tdiscovered, most likely Venus or Diana. In the western room 22, the existence of two mortar floors\\n21\\twas confirmed. On the northern fa�ade and within trench 72 remains of a destroyed furnace\\n22\\t(_praefurnium_) were discovered (Fig. 1), indicating that during the second villa phase, the\\n23\\tpraefurnium and the hypocaust were no longer in use.\\n24\\t\\n25\\t         Walls of the room 22 were decorated with frescos. On the floor of this room, a large\\n26\\tconcentration of wattle with reed imprints was unearthed, originating from the ceiling and bearing\\n27\\ttraces of frescos, which meant that the ceiling was painted, too.\\n28\\t\\n29\\t         Trenches outside the NW villa corner include stibadium B and the area around it. The\\n30\\tentrance into stibadium B was positioned in the south. On the northern side, beneath the stibadium,\\n31\\ta destroyed hypocaust furnace was discovered. On the eastern and the western stibadium side,\\n32\\trectangular annexes were unearthed with mosaic decorated floors and walls plated with marble. It is\\n33\\tcertain that stibadium B was later added to the northern fa�ade, while stibadium A was erected\\n34\\tsimultaneously with the villa itself. During this campaign, the mosaic with floral ad geometrical\\n35\\tmotifs was fully unearthed. A large number of mosaic tiles (_tesserae_) made of glass was found,\\n36\\tindicating that the ceiling was also decorated with mosaic.\\n37\\t\\n38\\t         This year's excavations confirmed that during the second building horizon (from about 330\\n39\\tto 378) there were two building phases. During the second phase, the villa was decorated with\\n40\\tmosaics, frescos and sculptures. Although during the first phase, the structure mainly played an\\n41\\tadministrative role, during the second one, it became a luxurious residence with ceremonial\\n42\\tcharacter.\\n43\\t\\n44\\tSource: Gavrilovi N., Arheoloska istrazivanja na Medijani u 2011. godini, Arheologija u Srbiji\\n45\\t(Projekti Arheoloskog instituta u 2011. godini), Beograd 2012, 78-81.\\n46\\t\\fFig. 1. ediana, northern profile of the room 22 and hypocaust remains with praefurnium (after:\\n47\\tGavrilovi 2012, 78, Sl. 2).\\n48\\t\\n49\\tFig. 2. diana, mosaic with geometrical and floral motifs in stibadium B (after: Gavrilovi 2012,\\n50\\t79, Sl. 1).\\n51\\t\\n52\\tFig. 3. diana, the southern porch of the villa with peristyle (after: Gavrilovi 2012, 80, Sl. 3).\\n53\\t\\n54\\tBibliography:\\n55\\t\\n56\\t .,  �   , , 1994.\\n57\\t\\n58\\tVasi M., Bronze Railing from Mediana,  LIII�LIV/ 2003�2004, 79-109, Beograd.\\n59\\t\\n60\\t                                                 ME 2011\\n61\\t\\n62\\t                80    \\n63\\t.   2011.        .\\n64\\t     ,    -, \\n65\\t  6500 2.           \\n66\\t  ,      - \\n67\\t   .\\n68\\t\\n69\\t          2011.      ,  \\n70\\t,          .   \\n71\\t          95 (7,30  2 )  96 (3,80  2\\n72\\t).      -22     ,  \\n73\\t    .     .\\n74\\t\\n75\\t           ,   ,     97,      98,\\n76\\t103  104.   97 (6,70  4 )       \\n77\\t,     .\\n78\\t\\n79\\t              46  47     ,\\n80\\t   .    22,    \\n81\\t .       72    \\n82\\t (. 1),           \\n83\\t .\\n84\\t\\n85\\t           22    .     \\n86\\t              \\n87\\t,         .\\n88\\t\\n89\\t                    .\\n90\\t       .   ,  ,  \\n91\\t  .        \\n92\\t           \\n93\\t.           ,   \\n94\\t\\f         .      \\n95\\t      .      \\n96\\t ,           .\\n97\\t\\n98\\t                  \\n99\\t(  330.  378)    .   ,    \\n100\\t,   .         \\n101\\t ,       \\n102\\t.\\n103\\t\\n104\\t: Gavrilovi N., Arheoloska istrazivanja na Medijani u 2011. godini, Arheologija u Srbiji\\n105\\t(Projekti Arheoloskog instituta u 2011. godini), Beograd 2012, 78-81.\\n106\\t\\n107\\t. 1. ,    22     \\n108\\t(: Gavrilovi 2012, 78, Sl. 2).\\n109\\t. 2. ,          (:\\n110\\tGavrilovi 2012, 79, Sl. 1).\\n111\\t. 3. ,      (: Gavrilovi 2012, 80, Sl. 3).\\n112\\t\\n113\\t:\\n114\\t 1994 � . ,  �   , .\\n115\\tVasi 2004 � M. Vasi, Bronze Railing from Mediana,  LIII�LIV/ 2003�2004, Beograd\\n116\\t\\f\\f\\f\"}]},\"uuid\":\"e9ab1748-f48d-4981-a47d-5a78a4fbf754\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-25T22:10:22.231Z\",\"sourceToolAssistantUUID\":\"a63c663c-f441-45df-b33d-ba2ce005f4d9\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"sdk-cli\",\"cwd\":\"C:\\\\Svemir\\\\data\\\\sessions\\\\c1792946760393lb6a\\\\medijana_baza\\\\roj_glm\\\\objekti_CD\",\"sessionId\":\"715a8e85-940b-40be-aca9-e0e9c9f6c39d\",\"version\":\"2.1.232\",\"gitBranch\":\"master\",\"slug\":\"cached-soaring-sedgewick\"}\n","isRawTranscript":true}}}
