{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_0cace3d1de9d4d949633563b","type":"tool_result","content":"29:цембра 1981. године, било категорисано као „непокретно културно добро од изузетног значаја”, и под бројем АН 22 уведено је у централни регистар споменика културе у Републици Србији.<ref>Латковић Р. и Дрча С. {{citation|author= |title=Медијана |location= |publisher= |year=1979}}, Народни музеј Ниш</ref>\n164:ре свега вила у стилу субурбане, терми, житница ({{jez-lat|horrea}}), али и објеката посебне намене ([[водоторањ]], [[акведукт|аквадукт]], [[штала|штале]], [[парк]]ови итд).<ref name=\"autogenerated1\">Дрча С., Naissus, ''Археолошко благо Ниша – од неолита до средњег века'', САНУ, Београд 2004, 49-58.5</ref>"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"call_586b64b53f2445699ef01253","session_id":"715a8e85-940b-40be-aca9-e0e9c9f6c39d","uuid":"43e0d369-be2d-455c-a479-89e3926cebc1","timestamp":"2026-10-25T22:11:20.214Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Lov na Drča 2000 objekat B"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202610260611191ecaab30a53a429f","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.3","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"- Line 33562 \"Milošević 2013\" is unrelated (Kapuran, Milošević 2013 — Mokranjske Stene, different Milošević).\n- Record 254: \"Stibadium B of villa with peristyle at Mediana\" — Gavrilović-Vitas, Nadežda; **Milošević-Jevtić, Gordana**; Crnoglavac, Vesna. Starinar 66 (2016), DOI 10.2298/STA1666081G (pages 81–?), handle 123456789/254, PDF bitstream 251.pdf, openAccess. Description: circular room NW segment of villa, north of room w-24, annexes E and W, analogous to stibadium A (NE section), marble slab wall facing, mosaic, 2015 excavations defined floor/wall heating, channel with lead pipe west of stibadium, terrain levelled north of northern wall.\n\nIMPORTANT NAME FINDING: \"Milošević-Jevtić, Gordana\" — in Starinar 66/2016 she is listed as Milošević-Jevtić. And the monograph (2016) lists \"Milošević, Gordana\". This is almost certainly the same person: Gordana Milošević, architect (Arhitektonski fakultet / AI), who also publishes as Gordana Milošević-Jevtić. So the \"G. Milošević\" of the target paper = Gordana Milošević(-Jevtić). Confidence: high on identity.\n\nAlso line 6488 \"Milošević-Jevtić, Gordana\" — another record. Let me check it.","signature":"2cac573d27604ad48f0589b2"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"call_58909c1e0d5f4aed9a483050","session_id":"715a8e85-940b-40be-aca9-e0e9c9f6c39d","uuid":"71957d1d-f95e-4714-838a-8f3308a22066","timestamp":"2026-10-25T22:11:25.141Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Lov na Milošević Urbanism Mediana"}
