{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20261026061524cf58350864b549f4","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.3","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Glob reveals files I haven't fully exploited:\n- `skinuto/jeremic_mozaici_2009.pdf` + `.txt` — Jeremić 2009 \"New Archaeological Data on the Mosaics in Mediana near Nis\" (abstract mentioned by agent: coin of Constantius II 341-346 terminus post quem). The .txt is on disk — I should read it!\n- `skinuto/aus2015_mediana.txt` — extracted Mediana report from AUS 2015! Not in my earlier summary. Read it.\n- `skinuto/aus2016/2017/2018/2020/2021.txt` — more AUS volumes; the agent (af3648) was working on aus2019. Have aus2016-2021 been grepped for Medijana? Not sure all. Let me grep \"edijana\" across skinuto/*.txt for new measures.\n- `rai_3503.html`, `rai_783.html` — RAI pages fetched earlier.\n- `fasti_mediana.json` — Fasti record for Mediana.\n- `scindeks1.html` — SCIndeks search results.\n\nLet me:\n1. Read skinuto/jeremic_mozaici_2009.txt (probably short abstract).\n2. Read skinuto/aus2015_mediana.txt (extracted Mediana section from AUS 2015).\n3. Grep \"edijana\" in skinuto/aus2016.txt, aus2017, aus2018, aus2020, aus2021 to see if Mediana reports exist there (2016-2021 seasons — could contain objects C/D!). This is valuable: AUS = Arheologija u Srbiji, annual reports of all excavations. Medijana campaigns 2015-2021 (muzej/RAI) would be reported!\n\nLet me do these in parallel.","signature":"2f42d982a80e489faa55182c"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"715a8e85-940b-40be-aca9-e0e9c9f6c39d","uuid":"72c83348-0418-4192-8aa7-b02a9a4245c0","timestamp":"2026-10-25T22:15:30.826Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20261026061524cf58350864b549f4","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.3","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Na disku su neiskorišćeni fajlovi: `jeremic_mozaici_2009.txt`, `aus2015_mediana.txt` (izdvojeno poglavlje!), i AUS sveske 2016–2021 koje možda sadrže izveštaje sa Medijane za te godine. Proveravam sve odjednom:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"715a8e85-940b-40be-aca9-e0e9c9f6c39d","uuid":"5c346d65-0d2b-4e9f-ad36-3f1a7992ccc3","timestamp":"2026-10-25T22:15:31.890Z"}
