{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202610260616226e07cb50262e48e5","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.3","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"fasti_search.html is the Fasti home page (not search results). fasti_n.html similar probably. Dead ends locally.\n\nLocal mining exhausted for direct objekat B material. Summary of what locals gave:\n- S. Drča = Slobodan Drča (co-author with Gavrilović, Jeremić; Narodni muzej Niš).\n- No objekat A/B/C/D data in local files.\n\nNow the live web via webReader, one call at a time with pauses. Highest-value URLs:\n\n1. SCIndeks search for Drča Slobodan. SCIndeks is at https://scindeks.ceon.rs/. Their search: https://scindeks.ceon.rs/search.aspx?search=... Actually SCIndeks new URL scheme: article.aspx?articleid=XXXX. There's an author search: https://scindeks.ceon.rs/authors.aspx?name=... I'm not sure. Try: https://scindeks.ceon.rs/search.aspx?search=drca — if error, try https://scindeks.ceon.rs/en/search?query=... hmm.\n\nActually SCIndeks moved to a new platform (scindeks.ceon.rs). The search endpoint: https://scindeks.ceon.rs/search.aspx?search=drca returned error before. Maybe correct param: https://scindeks.ceon.rs/search.aspx?search=drca&sm=1... I can't guess reliably. Google cache alternative.\n\n2. muzejnis.rs — National Museum Niš site: publications page. Try https://muzejnis.rs/ or https://muzejnis.rs/publikacije/. \n\n3. doiserbia.nb.rs search: https://doiserbia.nb.rs/search.aspx?search=drca — doiserbia search URL format is actually http://doiserbia.nb.rs/search.aspx?search=... let me just try.\n\n4. Google Scholar: https://scholar.google.com/scholar?q=... — likely blocked for bots but webReader (server-side) may work.\n\n5. VIAF/Wikipedia for Drča.\n\n6. WorldCat for Zbornik NN 9.\n\nLet me pace: one call, wait ~45-90s, next. Start with the most valuable: SCIndeks author/article for Drča. Actually first try doiserbia search since it's the canonical index and its URL worked before (it returned a page, which my past self saved? No — the doiserbia fetch was denied). Hmm, no saved doiserbia search.\n\nLet me think about what's known about Zbornik Narodnog muzeja u Nišu online: it IS digitized? The Niš museum published PDFs of old zbornik issues? Not that I know. SCIndeks has Zbornik Narodnog muzeja u Nišu (ISSN 0354-4242? no, that's something else; Zbornik NM Niš ISSN 0354-4242...). Hmm. Actually \"Zbornik Narodnog muzeja u Nišu\" — SCIndeks journal at https://scindeks.ceon.rs/journaldetails.aspx?issn=... I don't remember.\n\nI'll try in this order:\nA. https://scindeks.ceon.rs/search.aspx?search=drca (maybe redirects to results)\nB. https://muzejnis.rs (museum site nav → publications)\nC. https://scholar.google.com/scholar?q=%22Medijana%22+%22objekat+B%22 (ASCII-encoded quotes %22 might fail the tool's URL check... earlier %22+Drca format failed with \"Correct URL Format\" when combined with %C4%8A. Let me avoid %22, use plus-separated words: scholar.google.com/scholar?q=Medijana+objekat+B+Drca)\nD. doiserbia search.\nE. CEEOL search for Zbornik NN — CEEOL has Zbornik Narodnog muzeja u Nišu! CEEOL journal page: https://www.ceeol.com/search/journal-detail?id=... CEEOL has TOCs visible. Zbornik NN on CEEOL would give TOC of vol 9 with Drča article title/abstract. CEEOL search URL: https://www.ceeol.com/search/article?id=... can't guess. Try https://www.ceeol.com/search/?q=Medijana+objekat ... hmm.\n\nStart with A.","signature":"3f37e62563d147a4956c3995"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"call_586b64b53f2445699ef01253","session_id":"715a8e85-940b-40be-aca9-e0e9c9f6c39d","uuid":"a3d1879f-982b-4e6c-b149-6166d7f4a7e3","timestamp":"2026-10-25T22:16:39.929Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Lov na Drča 2000 objekat B"}
