{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20261026061645d969fe6149a646cc","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.3","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"- fasti_mediana.json = API error (\"does not support search\") — another dead channel, record honestly.\n- scindeks1.html = 404 error page (SCIndeks Search.aspx dead) — record honestly.\n\nBoth are negative results. Now I have everything to write the deliverables. Let me write nalaz.md now — comprehensive but tight. Then mera.json.\n\nOne more check — do I know the exact sr-wiki URL for citation? https://sr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Медијана — in the file srwiki_medijana.wikitext. I'll cite it as https://sr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Медијана (percent-encoded form may be needed: https://sr.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%9C%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%B8%D1%98%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B0). I'll use the readable Cyrillic form since it's for humans; both work in browsers.\n\nDates: today 2026-10-25. Session date for \"poslednja provera\".\n\nFor the Meduza paper (Jeremić 2017): local copy skinuto/jeremic_meduza_2017.pdf/.txt; RAI record — which handle? From earlier summary it's from Ante Portam Auream; I don't have its exact URL in context now. The file was downloaded from somewhere in the earlier session. I'll cite the local copy + note \"RAI/Ante portam auream 2017, 109–121\" (DOI 10.2298? no that was Jagodin Mala). Ante portam auream: studies in honour of M. B. Vujović? The aus2017 bibliography line 1549: \"Cvijeti J., A Stamped Shield Boss from Municipium S. (Montenegro), in: M. B. Vujovi (ed.), Ante portam auream.\" — so Ante portam auream ed. M. B. Vujović, Beograd 2017. The Jagodin Mala DOI 10.2298/STA1767109J was Starinar 67. The Meduza paper: \"Representation of Medusa on a Mosaic Floor in Mediana\", in Ante portam auream (ed. M. B. Vujović), Beograd 2017. I recall pages 145-158? No — that's Jeremić 2006. Don't fabricate pages. I'll cite without page numbers, noting local copy.\n\nLet me now write nalaz.md. Structure decided above. Keep it in Serbian latinica, use osnova/situacioni plan/presek correctly. Every claim with source + confidence.\n\nmera.json — array of objects: id, opis, mere, izvor, poverenje. I'll add \"napomena\" where conflicts. Actually keep the schema from ZADATAK: id, opis, mere, izvor, poverenje. I can put conflict notes in opis or add \"konflikt\" field — extra fields are fine for JSON but stick close to spec; I'll add optional \"konflikt\" only where needed.\n\nMeasures list (final):\n1. vila-peristil-osnova: 98,6 × 63 m — izvor: Jeremić 2006 preko sr-wiki (lin. 198); URL wiki + ubnt PDF; poverenje srednje (tercijarni prenos, primarni URL poznat)\n2. vila-peristil-povrsina: konflikt ~6.500 m² (FASTI 2011/tapavicki) vs 6.800 m² (wiki/Jeremić 2006)\n3. vila-peristil-mozaici: 945 m² (wiki, v0.14 već uklopljeno ~780,9 katalog + konflikt 945/1000 rešen u bazi) — maybe skip since baza rešila? Include with note.\n4. aula-vila-peristil: 19,6 × 12 m, apsa dubine 5,2 m (Jeremić 2017, lokalna kopija) — visoko\n5. mozaici-aula: 5,5×5,5 m, ⌀2,8 m, ⌀0,8 m, 2,4 m (Jeremić 2017) — visoko\n6. triklinijum-mozaik: ~55 m² (wiki lin. 204 → Jeremić 2006/muzej) — srednje\n7. trem-peristil-sever: ~450 m² (wiki lin. 208) — srednje\n8. hodnik-vila-terme: 100 m² (wiki lin. 200) — srednje\n9. vila-sa-konhama: dužina 32,5 m, orijentacija I–Z, ulaz istočno, trikonhna zapadna prostorija (monografija 2016 preko wiki; Zotović 1975 Arheološki pregled 17, 75–77 prvo istraživanje) — srednje-visoko\n10. vila-sa-oktogonom: ~3.150 m², „Amadžijska njiva\" (wiki lin. 217) — srednje\n11. horreum-dolia-bazeni: dolia ~2 m; bazeni do 1,40 m dubine (wiki lin. 244–248) — srednje\n12. sonde-2011: sonda 95: 7,30×2 m; 96: 3,80×2 m; 97: 6,70×4 m (Gavrilović 2012, 78–81 preko FASTI/tapavicki_2011.txt lokalna kopija) — visoko\n13. naselje-povrsina: konflikt ~40 ha (wiki/Drča) vs ~80 ha (FASTI 2011; Jeremić 2017: „~80 ha, >20 objekata + geomagnetske strukture\") — upisati konflikt\n14. geomagnetska-istraga: 16 struktura (Milošević