{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202610260619369ec0c2b5e7364ee6","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.3","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Bash with curl is denied (the earlier `ls` slipped through but curl is denied). Back to webReader only.\n\nLet me try the coordinator's suggested variants via webReader:\n1. Without www: http://ubnt.ni.ac.rs/images/pdf/nisivizantija/Nis+i+Vizantija+-+04_2005/10_Jeremic_Gordana.pdf\n2. Maybe the site moved to a new structure: ubnt.ni.ac.rs might redirect. Let me also try the root: http://ubnt.ni.ac.rs/ to see if host is alive at all.\n\nActually — an important alternative: the PDF might be mirrored on the new nisandbyzantium.org.rs site which returned empty content via webReader (JS-heavy). Try Google cache? No. Try the Scribd? No.\n\nLet me try two more webReader calls (rate limit seems to allow ~5/minute; recent calls went through). Variant without www, and the host root.","signature":"889c2d890b774042988e2e93"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"call_228a9101adba430ca741f6e2","session_id":"715a8e85-940b-40be-aca9-e0e9c9f6c39d","uuid":"8a26e4ed-2a71-4054-9edf-b3fb3a3818c1","timestamp":"2026-10-25T22:19:40.614Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Lov na Jeremić 2006 mozaici"}
