{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20261026062501ba6bde9369a34b65","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.3","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent harvest! Key Mediana records in the RAI repository (oai_full.xml). For my task — objects A–D / objekat B — the most promising with abstracts:\n\n1. oai_full.xml:43879 \"Constantine's Villa at Mediana\" (2016 monograph!) — the big monograph. Its abstract may describe the complex's buildings (A, B, C, D).\n2. oai_full.xml:3092 \"Excavations of Mediana in 2010 and 2011\" — abstract may mention buildings around villa.\n3. oai_full.xml:4820 \"Stibadium B of villa with peristyle at Mediana\" — stibadium B (not objekat B, but valuable).\n4. oai_full.xml:1756 \"Venus or Diana from Mediana\".\n5. oai_full.xml:44019 Dionysus group.\n6. oai_full.xml:45786 \"The Latest Archaeological Discoveries about the Mediana Mosaics\".\n7. oai_full.xml:49776 \"Medijana 2011\" (Fasti record).\n8. oai_full.xml:58968 \"The building with vaults in the center of the late antique city of Naissus\" — not Mediana.\n\nLet me read the records with descriptions: around lines 43879 (Constantine's Villa), 3092 (already read the header — need description), 4820, 45786, 44019, 1756, 49776. Read each region ~40 lines.","signature":"8f17e75dc9f745218ed5ab08"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"call_586b64b53f2445699ef01253","session_id":"715a8e85-940b-40be-aca9-e0e9c9f6c39d","uuid":"26e05696-0632-4e6c-9ff7-5ddf28137ea4","timestamp":"2026-10-25T22:25:07.204Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Lov na Drča 2000 objekat B"}
