svim pogodicima iz sekcije 7 (naslov, autor, godina, izvor, strane, tačan URL, sadržaj, nivo poverenja), novootkrivenim živim URL-ovima i snippet-sadržajem, iskrenom listom zatvorenih stavki i verbatim upozorenjem na ZAMKU: „mere 'objekat A 17,20×14,60 m / objekat B 20,30×14,18 / objekat C delimično' su iz Mlinčića-Tisine kod Zenice, NE sa Medijane — ne primaj kao podatak o Medijani.\\\"\\n\\nIf you need specific details from before compaction (like exact code snippets, error messages, or content you generated), read the full transcript at: C:\\\\Svemir\\\\data\\\\providers\\\\zai\\\\claude\\\\projects\\\\C--Svemir-data-sessions-c1792946760393lb6a-medijana-baza-roj-glm-objekti-CD\\\\715a8e85-940b-40be-aca9-e0e9c9f6c39d.jsonl\\nContinue the conversation from where it left off without asking the user any further questions. Resume directly — do not acknowledge the summary, do not recap what was happening, do not preface with \\\"I'll continue\\\" or similar. Pick up the last task as if the break never happened.\"},\"isVisibleInTranscriptOnly\":true,\"isCompactSummary\":true,\"uuid\":\"0702caeb-29d4-4e94-9204-f9c95a8e5b74\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-25T22:27:47.642Z\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"sdk-cli\",\"cwd\":\"C:\\\\Svemir\\\\data\\\\sessions\\\\c1792946760393lb6a\\\\medijana_baza\\\\roj_glm\\\\objekti_CD\",\"sessionId\":\"715a8e85-940b-40be-aca9-e0e9c9f6c39d\",\"version\":\"2.1.232\",\"gitBranch\":\"master\",\"slug\":\"cached-soaring-sedgewick\"}\n332\t{\"parentUuid\":\"0702caeb-29d4-4e94-9204-f9c95a8e5b74\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"agentId\":\"af3648b6823f6e54f\",\"message\":{\"id\":\"msg_202610260627481491eee099a449d6\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"model\":\"glm-5.3\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"I have now hit the deadline. The embed content is ciphered (rotating substitution) — I can't reliably decode it. But actually, let me try one quick manual decode of the critical passage because I know the subject matter. Wait, let me reconsider — I noticed in the embed text: \\\"Зпцньтнкбж внкж, впцавжтба заднибштж ш дамж Оабьтжбтнбж C\\\" — contains literal \\\"C\\\". Hmm — if I decode systematically... Let me try once more with fresh eyes, because if the cipher is a consistent single substitution I CAN build the table from this very passage since I know a lot of proper names.\\n\\nTake \\\"Ешлпѝж Епднѝжбж\\\" — appears after \\\"лицждж\\\" (dr.? \\\"др\\\"). If \\\"лицждж\\\" = \\\"др\\\" that's 2→5 mismatch, so no. Maybe \\\"лицждж\\\" = \\\"Др.\\\" in some rendering? No.\\n\\nAlternative hypothesis: The obfuscation is a per-character shift with position-dependent increment (rotating Caesar), like shift = k + position. Test on \\\"Kgrdl`l Noroac}\\\" which should be \\\"Gordana Jeremic\\\" (13 incl space) — actual \\\"Kgrdl`l Noroac}\\\" (14 incl space). Hmm \\\"Gordana Jeremic\\\" = 14 chars with space. K→G shift -4 (K=75, G=71). g→o: g=103, o=111, shift +8. No fixed or simple linear pattern... rotating by +? position 1: -4, position 2: +8, difference +12. Position 3: r→r = 0? diff from +8 is -8. Not linear.\\n\\nOK here's another thought: it doesn't matter. The literal \\\"C\\\" survived because uppercase Latin letters perhaps aren't remapped. And \\\"?\\\" marks show digits were dropped. Numbers I need (mere osnova) are not recoverable from this cipher text anyway — they appear as \\\"??е²\\\". So even if I decode letters, the dimensions are literally eaten (\\\"34?е2\\\", \\\"аоа ??е2\\\" — the superscript 2 = m² survives!). So the ciphered embed CANNOT give me measurements. Full stop — decoding won't yield the data the coordinator wants most (mere).\\n\\nGiven \\\"deadline je sada, dugovacke petlje ne trebaju\\\" — I must deliver the final report NOW as clean text.\\n\\nLet me assemble everything with high care.\\n\\nKey finds recap for report:\\n\\n1. **Jeremić 2006** — \\\"Mozaici Medijane – neka razmatranja\\\" (Мозаици Медијане – нека разматрања), Niš i Vizantija IV (Zbornik radova IV, Četvrti naučni skup, Niš 3–5. jun 2005), Centar za crkvene studije, Niš 2006, str. 145–158 (14 strana — potvrđeno i time što Scribd kopija ima tačno 14 strana). Live URL-ovi:\\n   - zvanični PDF simpozijuma: https://www.nisandbyzantium.org.rs/doc/zbornik4/PDF-IV/Gordana Jeremic.pdf (razmak u imenu fajla)\\n   - Univerzitetska biblioteka Niš legacy: http://www.ubnt.ni.ac.rs/legacy/images/pdf/nisivizantija/Nis i Vizantija - 04_2005/10_Jeremic_Gordana.pdf\\n   - Scribd kopija (14 strana, otpremio Dragan Taneski): https://www.scribd.com/document/462516922/JEREMIC-Gordana-Mozaci-Medijane-Neka-Razmatrania — actually URL: https://www.scribd.com/document/462516922/ЈЕРЕМИЋ-Гордана-Мозаици-Медијане-Нека-Разматрања (translit: JEREMIC-Gordana-Mozaci-Medijane-Neka-Razmatranja)\\n   Sadržaj (iz DDG snippet-a indeksiranog sa oba PDF-a): početak rada — \\\"Antičko naselje Medijana, udaljeno od Naissus-a tri rimske milje u pravcu jugoistoka, smešteno je u plodnoj dolini omeđenoj tokom Nišave na severu i Vlaškim brdom na jugu. Prostire se na površini od oko 40 hektara (sl. 1...)\\\" + header \\\"Niš i Vizantija 145\\\".\\n   Iz Scribd embeda (obfuskovan tekst, DELOMIČNO čitljive strukture, str. ~149-150): pominjanje \\\"objekat C\\\" (u kontekstu \\\"južno od objekta C\\\" / \\\"prema objektu C\\\" — tačna rečenica nije pouzdano dekodiva), mozaik ~ površine sa sl. 8, novac ispod <389? (godina nije pouzdana — cifra pojedena), \\\"đardini/żyvina... vivarium (uvcus = parcs?)\\\" — fusnota 2 govori o identifikaciji uvcus-a kod Jeremića: referencira Ж. Манo-Зиси? (Ж. Ацэнњ Ькжвптнњ = ?), konferencija \\\"Rimski sarkofazi... u Beču 2005?\\\" — hmm, fusnota citira: \\\"Ж. Ацэнњ Ькжвптнњ, Жцяпакаэож ньтцжйнвжўж ш Бнэш н аоакнбн\\\" — dekodujem približno: \\\"?. ????, Саркофаг... римски... у Београду...\\\" — zapravo: \\\"Ьтжцнбжц YCCC‘C] (<388‘84), 86?‘8<6\\\" izgleda kao \\\"Starinar LIV (2003–04), 161–167\\\"? — nije pouzdano. NEĆU dekodovano stavljati kao činjenice — samo