{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20261026063138a57f4be711b34c2c","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.3","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"ubnt legacy URL — 404 (the + encoding mangled the path; the real file has spaces; DDG indexed it but the server wants %20 which webReader rejects). nisandbyzantium — -500 network (tool-side).\n\nBoth fail. Enough. Time to deliver my final report. I have plenty of material:\n\nMY task (objekti_CD / Drča 2000 objekat B + A/C/D):\n1. S. Drča = Slobodan Drča, Narodni muzej Niš (Latković+Drča 1979 vodič \"Medijana\"; Drča 2004 \"Naissus\" u Arheološko blago Niša SANU 49-58; koautorstva).\n2. Drča 2000 \"Medijana — objekat B\", Zbornik NN Niš 9 (2000) 21-36 — NOT available online: official museum Zbornik page shows only covers (issues z16-z33), issue 9/2000 not digitized; doiserbia has nothing (Zbornik NN Niš not among 67 doiSerbia journals); SCIndeks dead link; no PDF anywhere. Confidence: nisko (bibliographic record only).\n3. Janković-Mihaldžić = Dušanka Janković-Mihaldžić (numizmatičarka NMN). NEW FIND: bibliografije.nb.rs records — two articles in Naissus br. 1 (2008): \"Pojedinačni nalazi rimskog novca na Mediani\" (str. 25-73, COBISS.SR-ID 157322252) and \"Skupni nalaz rimskog bronzanog novca iz Mediane\" (str. 75-95, COBISS.SR-ID 157323532) — almost certainly the expanded version of her objekat B coin work; the \"Mediana Numismatic Catalogue\" referenced by Jeremić 2009. Naissus not digitized online either. Zbornik NN 10 (2001) article itself: not online. Confidence: srednje for the 2008 expansion (full bibliographic records with summaries), nisko for the 2001 original.\n4. Objekti A, C, D: no identification found anywhere accessible. Museum's own Medijana page names structures without letters (vila sa peristilom, terme, skladište/vinski podrum, vila s oktogonalnom kulom i velikim salama, dve ranohrišćanske crkve, nekropola; ~20 objects total; 3 construction phases; intensive life 330-361; destroyed 441-443). Petrović 1994 numbering 1-15 (not letters). Only hints: (a) parent's speculation that A-D are buildings east of the villa (unconfirmed); (b) background agent's ciphered Scribd layer of Jeremić 2006 possibly mentioning \"objekat C\" (unreliable); (c) Jeremić 2006 str. 145-157 has the six-mosaic-objects overview — PDF live but unfetchable by my tools.\n5. RAI resources: monografija \"Constantine's Villa at Mediana\" 2016 PDF (bitstream_4423) — the single most likely source resolving objekat B/A/C/D; Excavations 2010-2011 (Starinar 64, PDF 92/207.pdf); Stibadium B Starinar 66 (PDF 123/251.pdf); Dionysus 2017; Mosaics 2009; Fasti Medijana 2011.\n6. Recommendation: parent (which can curl) should download: \n   - http://rai.ai.ac.rs/bitstream/id/4423/bitstream_4423.pdf (monografija 2016)\n   - https://www.nisandbyzantium.org.rs/doc/zbornik4/PDF-IV/Gordana%20Jeremic.pdf (Jeremić 2006, 145-158 — šest objekata sa mozaicima; moguće oznake A-D)\n   - numizmatika branch log line 417 has \"objekat B\" trace.\n7. Zenica trap — restate verbatim.\n8. Closed: doiserbia (67 journals, no Zbornik NN), museum site digitization, SCIndeks 404, Academia Cloudflare, Google Books quota, HathiTrust 403, Fasti API, sibling numizmatika sandbox, ubnt legacy fetch (404 via +, -400 via %20), nisandbyzantium (-500).\n\nFormat: Serbian latinica, clean text, per-hit: title, author, year, URL, what it brings, confidence level; honest closed list at the end. No files. This is my final message — the caller relays it.","signature":"3a60a5ce687a402a80f9e2e0"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"call_586b64b53f2445699ef01253","session_id":"715a8e85-940b-40be-aca9-e0e9c9f6c39d","uuid":"d37d145e-1736-40d4-973e-e7ee6121ccad","timestamp":"2026-10-25T22:32:17.462Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Lov na Drča 2000 objekat B"}
